### Criando categoria

POST http://localhost:3000/categories HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Docinhos",
    "slug": "docinhos"
}

### Ler products

GET http://localhost:3000/categories HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json


### Ler products por id
GET http://localhost:3000/categories/by-slug/bolo-fixo/products HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

### Delete

DELETE http://localhost:3000/categories/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json